msgstr "Me he quedado sin crackers."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PARROT_BLUE.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PARROT_BLUE.DEAD"
