msgstr "¿Son siquiera de la misma especie?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PEEKHEN.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PEEKHEN.SLEEPING"
