msgstr "¡Esa casa está ardiendo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_CITY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_CITY.GENERIC"
