msgstr "¡Esa granja está ardiendo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_FARM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_FARM.GENERIC"
