#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_FARMER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_FARMER.SLEEPING"
