#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SHIPWRECKED_ENTRANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SHIPWRECKED_ENTRANCE"
