msgstr "Hay una brisa fresca soplando fuera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_SHRUB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_SHRUB"
