msgstr "Ooh... Un martillito muy cuco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.BALLPHIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.BALLPHIN"
