msgstr "Ligero. Me gusta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.FEATHERSAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.FEATHERSAIL"
