msgstr "Los mejillones se quedan pegados."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.MYSTERYMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.MYSTERYMEAT"
