msgstr "Espero que vuelva a crecer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.NETTLE.MOIST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.NETTLE.MOIST"
