msgstr "Jope. Huele a medicina."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.NIGHTLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.NIGHTLIGHT"
