msgstr "La materia de las pesadillas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT"
