#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_DELI.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_DELI.GENERIC"
