msgstr "¡Ahí va!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.DEAD"
