msgstr "Hasta nunca, cosa mala!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.GENERIC"
