msgstr "¡Repugnantísimo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.SLEEPING"
