msgstr "¡Bah! Fruta odiosa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_COOKED"
