msgstr "Un artefacto con plumas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN"
