msgstr "Ah, no debe de ser buena hora."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_ENTRANCE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_ENTRANCE2"
