msgstr "¿Adónde conduce?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_HEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_HEAD"
msgid "I suppose pigs lived here once."
