msgstr "Ah. ¡El exterior!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_ROUND_BURLAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_ROUND_BURLAP"
