#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_WALL_SUNFLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_WALL_SUNFLOWER"
