msgstr "Agreste."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_MARBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_MARBLE"
