msgstr "¡Ja! Me acuerdo de este."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER"
