msgstr "¡AAAAAAAAAAH!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.BILL.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.BILL.DEAD"
