msgstr "¡Por fin lo hemos encontrado!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KRAKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KRAKEN"
