msgstr "Esta roca es bastante dura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ROC_HEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.ROC_HEAD"
