msgstr "Pronto se quemará del todo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNT"
