msgstr "Prenda impermeable inspirada en la fauna."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_WEEVOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_WEEVOLE"
