msgstr "El rosa no es realmente mi color."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARMOUREDBOAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ARMOUREDBOAT"
