msgstr "Qué bien poder tratar con un adulto maduro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_PROFESSOR.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_PROFESSOR.SLEEPING"
