msgstr "Supongo que eso es de esperar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_QUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_QUEEN"
