msgstr "Una tienda de objetos esotéricos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_BANK.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_BANK.BURNING"
