msgstr "Una luz portátil improvisada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOUCAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOUCAN"
