msgstr "Probablemente le pase algo malo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYERHOUSE_CITY.SOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYERHOUSE_CITY.SOLD"
