msgstr "Construiré mi propia chimenea para encender fuegos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_TUDOR_CRAFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_TUDOR_CRAFT"
