msgstr "Ja, ja, es blandito."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH_COOKED"
