#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.RECONSTRUCTION_PROJECT.RUBBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.RECONSTRUCTION_PROJECT.RUBBLE"
