#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.RECONSTRUCTION_PROJECT.SCAFFOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.RECONSTRUCTION_PROJECT.SCAFFOLD"
