msgstr "¿Es Navidad, Lucy?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECO_WOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DECO_WOOD"
