msgstr "¿Ahora para qué sirve?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEFLATED_BALLOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DEFLATED_BALLOON"
