#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS_ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS_ACTIVE"
