msgstr "Bah. Qué forma de talar tan mala."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ROC_ROBIN_EGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ROC_ROBIN_EGG"
