msgstr "Prefiero los de madera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_HATTREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_HATTREE"
