msgstr "Una cosa inútil donde las haya."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY2"
