msgstr "Un hipocampo de tierra firme."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.ZEB.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.ZEB.SLEEPING"
